WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.580
Hey, pipe down.

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.920
Yes, sir.

00:00:08.410 --> 00:00:11.350
Last year was pretty hectic,

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.830
but this year, I got to relax 
and enjoy my birthday.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:17.740
I'm glad you had fun, Kirishima.

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:20.340
Thank you very much for the drawing, too.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.410
Did it look like you?

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.430
Yes. It's much better than the real thing.

00:00:25.930 --> 00:00:28.630
I'll be putting that drawing up in my room.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:31.750
I'll draw it even better next year.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.630
I'll be looking forward to 
my next birthday, then.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.730
Come to think of it, it's been a while 
now since I became your babysitter.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:41.730
Uh-huh.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:43.990
So many things have happened.

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.780
I got to see Mommy, and it was really nice.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:52.030
I also met Koki-kun, Sara, and Kaede-chan.

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:56.770
I'm so glad I made so many friends this year.

00:00:58.630 --> 00:00:59.930
What about you?

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:02.980
How was your year?

00:01:03.740 --> 00:01:05.210
Well...

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:10.340
I think I spent my year thinking 
I still need to try harder.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.570
Harder?

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.600
For example, getting better at 
learning people's names and faces,

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.840
and not getting yelled at 
by the boss as much.

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:20.440
And most of all...

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.860
to make sure I don't ever make you sad.

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:28.980
Your mother and father

00:01:29.370 --> 00:01:32.100
really love your smile,
and everyone else does, too.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.680
Yay, good job!

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.550
Whenever you smile, 
it makes everyone else smile.

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:44.210
That's why I'm going to work even
 harder as your babysitter

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.410
to make sure you can always keep smili—

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.900
Mrr.

00:01:53.160 --> 00:01:55.170
Little lady, what was that, exactly?

00:01:55.820 --> 00:02:01.010
Well, you didn't seem to be enjoying 
talking about the past very much...

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:03.440
so I was trying to make you laugh.

00:02:05.820 --> 00:02:06.730
Little lady...

00:02:07.320 --> 00:02:08.850
Could you do that again?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:09.870
No.

00:02:09.870 --> 00:02:12.120
Aw, come on. Please?

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:15.180
I'll be able to feel like 
I had the best birthday ever

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:17.100
if I get to see that one more time.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.130
Really?

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:19.490
Absolutely.

00:02:20.140 --> 00:02:22.160
Okay, just once more.

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:23.860
Thank you kindly.

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:26.140
Ready, and...

00:02:26.140 --> 00:02:27.400
Mrr...

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:29.270
You didn't tell me you'd take a picture!

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:31.920
Now it's officially the best birthday ever.

00:02:32.680 --> 00:02:37.440
Little lady, I've had a lot of fun since 
I became your babysitter, too.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:42.340
After becoming your babysitter,
I'm able to look back on my year

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.860
as a good memory for the first time.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.850
Thank you for giving me so many memories.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.400
Next year...

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:54.230
Pardon?

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:58.780
Let's make even more memories from now on.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.650
Sure. I look forward to it.

00:03:23.180 --> 00:03:27.140
The Yakuza's Guide to Babysitting

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:48.720
<b>Episode 10: A Bad Person</b>

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:43.630
<b>Amaya Family</b>

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.270
Kirishima?

00:05:03.320 --> 00:05:04.520
Little lady.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.530
We're going to the park tomorrow.

00:05:07.720 --> 00:05:09.190
I'm aware.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:11.440
We have to go no matter what, okay?

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.800
Absolutely, no matter what.

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:15.810
Goodnight.

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:17.320
Mm.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.130
Little lady...

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.130
Can you really go?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:29.400
Don't worry. Go on to bed.

00:05:34.370 --> 00:05:40.220
Thanks for the valuable info. 
We'll take care of the rest.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:47.680
Let's go ahead and take away...

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.710
the thing he cares about most.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.130
The little lady's in a great mood.

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:01.100
She must be really happy 
to go to the park with you.

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.170
Well, I didn't get to go the other day.

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:07.000
So... why are they here, too?

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:11.380
I invited them! I figured 
the more the merrier!

00:06:11.380 --> 00:06:14.180
Why are <i>you</i> acting all fired up to play?

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:16.100
Yaeka!

00:06:17.070 --> 00:06:19.020
That's Sara-chan from next door, and...

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:21.990
This is my friend Kaede-chan.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:25.820
I-It's nice to meet you. I'm Akashi Kaede.

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:28.620
You've made a new friend, then.

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:30.850
That's great, little lady.

00:06:30.850 --> 00:06:31.700
Mm.

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.180
We're all gonna play together today.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:38.740
Yes! Let's play lots!

00:06:38.740 --> 00:06:39.750
Yeah!

00:06:40.940 --> 00:06:43.630
What do you want to play, little lady?

00:06:43.630 --> 00:06:45.410
Red light, green light.

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:47.260
<i>Red light, green light?!</i>

00:06:47.260 --> 00:06:49.630
You like that game, don't you, Kirishima?

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:50.930
Huh?

00:06:56.910 --> 00:06:59.100
Ah... Yes.

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>He does?!</i>

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:07.480
Green light...

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:08.650
Red light!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.020
<i>What the heck are we doing?</i>

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:18.160
<i>I can't believe we're playing 
this game at our age...</i>

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:22.540
Green light...

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:23.020
Kaede! Go, go, go!

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:24.710
Sara-chan! Are you okay?!

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:26.040
Red...

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.050
...light!

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:30.830
Sara-chan and Kaede-chan moved.

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:33.760
I went too fast on that green light.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:35.090
You did.

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.950
Come on, Kirishima-san.

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:45.140
Only losers move one step at a time like that.

00:07:41.950 --> 00:07:47.770
Green light...

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.160
Wha?

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.030
You need to be bolder 
and take bigger strides!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.150
You love red light, green light, don't you?

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:51.150
Red...

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:56.540
...light!

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.450
Kirishima and Sugihara moved.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:00.540
Yaeka wins!

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:03.790
Aw, too bad for me, I guess.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.790
Is he okay?

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:09.400
Sugihara-san, are you alive?!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:15.640
<b></b>Fuyutsuki Park

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:13.870
Little lady, what do you want to play next?

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.190
Hide and seek!

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:34.950
<b></b>I ended up finding
 the little lady first.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.570
<b></b>Won't the little lady get bored
 while I look for everyone else?

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:40.540
<b></b>But giving her a free 
pass might be rude, too...

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.150
The hell's he doing?

00:08:45.150 --> 00:08:47.590
Looks like he found someone.

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.380
He sorta froze up.

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.430
Oh? Looks like he's calmed down.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:55.210
He looks like he's made up his mind.

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.390
The hell?!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.150
What's wrong, Kanehira?!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.850
Why'd you punch yourself in the gut?

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.010
Kanehira...

00:09:03.630 --> 00:09:04.850
Huh?

00:09:05.140 --> 00:09:07.350
What happened to Kanehira?

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:11.630
Well... Looks like he got a stomachache.

00:09:15.220 --> 00:09:17.160
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:18.910
Oh.

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:21.410
Looks like I get to be it.

00:09:24.780 --> 00:09:26.420
<i>We're dead...</i>

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.280
I have a feeling he'll find us 
no matter where we hide.

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:38.190
Sugihara-san, I was thinking...

00:09:38.850 --> 00:09:42.680
Is this what it feels like to be the 
guys Kirishima-san goes after?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.840
Can you not say scary stuff like that?!

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.140
Also, why are you hiding in my spot?!

00:09:47.140 --> 00:09:50.360
Sorry... I was too scared to be on my own.

00:09:50.360 --> 00:09:54.760
At this rate, we're basically 
asking him to kill us both...

00:09:57.480 --> 00:09:59.620
Er, little lady?

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.860
You startled me.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:04.720
My ears got that really screechy sound.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.020
Did Kirishima come by?

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.120
If he did, we'd be dead!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:12.030
But thank goodness. 
If we're with the little lady...

00:10:15.050 --> 00:10:16.240
What's that sound?

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:22.600
I found...

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:25.100
all of you.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.250
<i>We're dead meat!</i>

00:10:29.330 --> 00:10:32.230
Yaeka-chan, Sara-chan, see you later.

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.170
Bye-bye, Kaede!

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:35.610
See you tomorrow.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.670
Today was a lot of fun.

00:10:38.670 --> 00:10:39.950
Yes!

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:43.120
You must really like playing 
at the park, little lady.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.500
It was a lot of fun because 
I have more friends now...

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:50.830
But when you're with me, Kirishima,

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.030
it's even more fun.

00:10:55.080 --> 00:10:59.170
I had a lot of fun playing with 
you today, too, little lady.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.250
Let's all go to the park again sometime.

00:11:04.640 --> 00:11:05.480
Yes, let's.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.060
Let's play again!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:09.380
<i>Never again...</i>

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.730
Kirishima-san, are you heading 
out to pick up the little lady?

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:19.750
Yeah.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:23.950
I think I'm finally getting used 
to you being her babysitter.

00:11:23.950 --> 00:11:25.550
The hell's that supposed to mean?

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:29.610
You're much more peaceful... 
Maybe even human-like.

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:32.240
The hell do you think I am to begin with?

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:34.300
Well, a demon, of cour—

00:11:34.710 --> 00:11:37.970
Ow!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:41.960
You better have the little 
lady's tea snacks ready.

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:45.680
He really is a demon...

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:47.930
What are you yelling about by yourself?

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:50.940
Boss?! Er, I'm sorry.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:55.170
Kirishima-san just left 
to pick up the little lady.

00:11:55.170 --> 00:11:58.840
I was just saying how 
familiar that's all becoming.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.560
Even as long as I've been here,

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:05.030
I've had the impression that 
Kirishima-san rarely came back here.

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:11.870
True.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:15.560
Maybe he's more human now.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.330
Hey there.

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:29.770
You're Sakuragi Yaeka-chan, aren't you?

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.860
Who the hell are you?

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:43.800
Don't be so cold, Kirishima.

00:12:43.800 --> 00:12:48.020
We haven't forgotten <i>you</i> for even a second.

00:12:48.020 --> 00:12:52.520
We came here to pay you back 
for crushing our family.

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:56.120
Like I can remember all 
that shit from the past.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:12:57.360
You bastard—

00:12:57.360 --> 00:13:00.730
Hold on, Igawa! Wait until 
Shinmoto gets here.

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.550
Damn it!

00:13:02.950 --> 00:13:05.420
If this is gonna take a while, 
I'll take a rain check.

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.050
I've gotta go get the little lady—

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.580
Your precious little lady is right here.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:12.850
Heya, Kirishima. You two sure must be close.

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.980
I told her I was your bud, 
and she tagged right along.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:23.440
Kirishima... Is he not your friend?

00:13:24.080 --> 00:13:25.520
I'm sorry, little lady.

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:28.570
I should've come to get you sooner.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.640
Kirishima!

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:38.390
Little lady...

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:40.790
Hey! Don't you dare move!

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:43.550
Or do you not care what happens to her?

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:46.510
You bastard... Get away from the little la—

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:47.720
Kirishima!

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.420
Stop! Why are you being mean to Kirishima?!

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:56.850
Oh, we're not being mean.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:14:00.380
Kirishima's a bad guy, 
so we're punishing him.

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:02.610
You've seen it in picture books, right?

00:14:02.610 --> 00:14:05.170
Bad guys need to be punished.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:07.010
We're just doing what's righ—

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.490
Don't lie to me!

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.240
Oh?

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:13.000
Kirishima's always nice.

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.920
He's always at the center of all of us!

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:16.970
He's not a bad person!

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:18.620
Kirishima is...

00:14:29.700 --> 00:14:31.010
Little lady?

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:36.020
The Yakuza's Guide to Babysitting

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:55.890
Hey, Shinmoto! What the hell are you doing?

00:14:55.890 --> 00:15:00.270
You said we were gonna use the kid 
to kill Kirishima, so we were waiting...

00:15:00.270 --> 00:15:04.380
It's fine. This brat was more useless 
than I thought she'd be.

00:15:05.820 --> 00:15:07.800
Die, Kirishima—

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:22.260
Hey...

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:23.400
This is bad...

00:15:37.460 --> 00:15:38.950
Stop...

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:41.710
Die.

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.320
Kiri...

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:52.820
...shima...

00:16:26.170 --> 00:16:30.550
<b></b>Fuyutsuki General Hospital

00:16:26.810 --> 00:16:30.550
She apparently has a mild concussion, 
but she should be all right.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.840
I'm so sorry, boss. I'll make sure 
this gets taken care of.

00:16:35.200 --> 00:16:39.190
Kirishima... Exactly what are 
you going to take care of?

00:16:40.490 --> 00:16:43.300
Is this regarding the fact 
that Yaeka got hurt...

00:16:44.130 --> 00:16:48.750
or what you're thinking 
about doing right now?

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:52.190
Listen, Kirishima.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:56.630
The moment they laid a hand on Yaeka, 
this became the Sakuragi Family's problem.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:17:02.080
The thing you should be doing 
right now is taking care of Yaeka.

00:17:02.600 --> 00:17:07.530
What Yaeka would want most when 
she wakes up is for you to be by her side.

00:17:08.080 --> 00:17:11.760
I'll take care of the ones who attacked you two.

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:13.990
Yes, sir.

00:17:27.320 --> 00:17:28.510
Little lady...

00:17:30.610 --> 00:17:35.320
<b></b>Fuyutsuki General Hospital

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:37.700
Kirishima-san,

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.700
the boss and I are heading back for a... bit...

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.290
Kirishima-san...

00:17:58.480 --> 00:17:59.510
Kirishima!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.930
Hey, Kirishima!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.890
Can't you hear me, damn it?!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:16.240
Nice... Those are the eyes 
I'm talking about, Kirishima!

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:19.660
That's what makes you worth killing!

00:18:21.780 --> 00:18:22.580
Huh?

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.250
Hey, wait a second, you bastard!

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.220
You won't get away, Kirishima!

00:18:28.550 --> 00:18:30.440
Today's the day I'm gonna murder you!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:31.150
Move.

00:18:31.150 --> 00:18:33.800
Huh?! I can't hear you!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.380
Move.

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:38.450
I said, I can't hear you!

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.920
And I said, "<i>Move</i>."

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.870
Looks like the demon's back.

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:03.620
It's no use. I can't get 
through to Kirishima-san.

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:06.790
That fool...

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:11.530
Sugihara, keep looking for any intel you 
can get on the ones who attacked them.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:12.500
Yes, sir.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:16.750
I'll worry about giving that fool a 
lecture after we take out the trash.

00:19:20.070 --> 00:19:21.340
Here you go.

00:19:23.070 --> 00:19:24.690
Are you really sure about this?

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.600
We just took a picture of 
some elementary school kid.

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:30.180
Oh, this is nothing.

00:19:30.180 --> 00:19:34.360
We're about to witness an 
exhilarating show, after all.

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.440
Thank you for your service.

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.500
Th-Thank you very much.

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.080
Wow...

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:45.060
By the way, have you heard 
from Shinmoto-san?

00:19:45.060 --> 00:19:48.960
Nah. The last I heard, he said 
he'd take care of everything.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.810
Speak of the devil. It's Shinmoto-san.

00:19:55.700 --> 00:19:57.790
Hello, Shinmoto-san?

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:03.890
<i>Huh? Maybe the reception's bad. Hello?</i>

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:05.970
<i>Hello?</i>

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:11.910
I wonder if that was actually enough...

00:20:11.910 --> 00:20:14.150
to cover all three of their hospital bills.

00:20:14.450 --> 00:20:16.600
According to Takeuchi's report,

00:20:16.600 --> 00:20:19.840
the guy found unconscious on the 
little lady's school route woke up,

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.610
and we found out his name is Shinmoto, 
formerly of the Amaya Family.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:26.170
Lately, he's teamed up with two 
guys named Igawa and Yano,

00:20:26.170 --> 00:20:29.080
who belonged to the Shirakawa Family.

00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:31.240
Amaya and Shirakawa...

00:20:31.680 --> 00:20:34.500
They're both families that 
Kirishima took out ten years ago.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:39.350
So they tried to mess with the little 
lady to get back at Kirishima-san?

00:20:41.570 --> 00:20:42.870
Takeuchi...

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:47.300
<i>Sugihara-san! I was just investigating 
the area around Shinmoto's office...</i>

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:52.060
and I found a few guys knocked out cold. 
I think they're Shinmoto's minions.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.890
Boss, does this mean...

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:58.000
Sugihara, get the car ready.

00:21:05.630 --> 00:21:07.570
Kirishima!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:10.120
You'll never get away with this.

00:21:10.620 --> 00:21:13.020
You took away our home!

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:14.080
I've...

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:15.950
spent the last ten years—

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:33.960
No, don't...

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:37.200
S-Stay away!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:41.350
That's it.

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:45.030
The crueler and more heartless 
you are, the more you shine.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:51.530
I'm so happy I get to see the real you again.

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:40.020
The Yakuza's Guide to Babysitting

00:23:35.050 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Time: Fireworks and Promises</b>
